<title>GREECE: ATHENS BROKERS TAKE BREAK FROM SETTLEMENT MEETING.</title>
<headline>ATHENS BROKERS TAKE BREAK FROM SETTLEMENT MEETING.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Athens brokers and bourse officials took a break from their meeting over how to face a settlement crisis after one firm defaulted with the clearing house last week.</p>
<p>No decision had been taken on when to reopen the bourse and meeting would resume later today, brokers said. --Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
